## 06 Testing Prompt

The following prompt was submitted without modification to all evaluated models.

```text
You are a Senior AI Product Consultant helping a SaaS company investigate a sudden decline in product performance.

Business Context:

Two weeks ago, the company released a redesigned onboarding experience.

Since the release:

• Day-7 retention dropped from 42% to 28%

• Trial-to-paid conversion decreased from 18% to 12%

• Customer support tickets increased by 37%

• Product analytics shows that approximately 70% of users abandon onboarding after Step 3.

• NPS decreased from 46 to 31.

• Several user interviews include comments such as:
"I wasn't sure what to do next."

Your task is NOT to immediately propose solutions.

Instead:

1. Investigate the problem.

2. Ask the most valuable clarification questions.

3. Explain why each question matters.

4. Generate possible hypotheses.

5. Prioritize the hypotheses.

6. Recommend the next investigation steps.

7. Explain what additional data should be collected before making any product decisions.

Think like an experienced Product Consultant.

Avoid making assumptions that are not supported by the evidence.
```
