## 3. Managing uncertainty is a critical consulting skill

The strongest investigations did not attempt to immediately identify the root cause.

Instead, they acknowledged uncertainty, identified missing evidence, and proposed systematic validation before recommending business decisions.

This behavior closely reflects real-world product discovery practices.

