## 5. AI evaluation should measure reasoning, not only correctness

Traditional AI benchmarks often emphasize factual accuracy.

This investigation demonstrates that business-oriented AI evaluation also requires assessing:

- reasoning quality;
- evidence discipline;
- investigation methodology;
- decision support;
- communication clarity.

These characteristics are essential for evaluating AI systems used in consulting and product management.

